message: "If you use Durg in research or writing, please cite it as below."
title: "Durg: a capability microkernel for isolating untrusted AI-agent tools"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Panda
    given-names: Venkatesh
repository-code: "https://github.com/VenkateshPanda0/Durg"
url: "https://github.com/VenkateshPanda0/Durg"
license: Apache-2.0
version: "0.1.0-alpha.1"
date-released: "2026-11-07"
abstract: >-
  Durg is a pre-alpha research kernel written in Rust: a capability microkernel for
  x86-64 that boots under QEMU and explores running untrusted AI-agent tools in
  isolation. It is not independently reviewed and is not a production security boundary.
keywords:
  - operating system
  - microkernel
  - capabilities
  - Rust
  - isolation
